==Strategy==
Mooth and Pigge should supply you with money. Use [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] is helpful too. Alternatively, [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] can be used to rush and easily destroy the enemy base. As in most [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] stages, [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat Mk II]] is a useful unit here.

